lse" bounds="[0,128][1080,2337]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.webkit.WebView" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="true" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,128][1080,2339]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,128][1080,2339]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="__mrcomic_paged_viewport" class="android.view.View" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,128][1039,2339]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="__mrcomic_paged_content" class="android.view.View" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,277][1039,2339]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="CHAPTER I. Down the Rabbit-Hole" resource-id="txt-chapter-1" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,277][1039,448]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="Alice was beginning to get very tired of sitting by her sister on the&#10;bank, and of having nothing to do: once or twice she had peeped into&#10;the book her sister was reading, but it had no pictures or&#10;conversations in it, “and what is the use of a book,” thought Alice&#10;“without pictures or conversations?”" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,477][1039,1159]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="2" text="So she was considering in her own mind (as well as she could, for the&#10;hot day made her feel very sleepy and stupid), whether the pleasure of&#10;making a daisy-chain would be worth the trouble of getting up and&#10;picking the daisies, when suddenly a White Rabbit with pink eyes ran&#10;close by her." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,1167][1039,1850]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="3" text="There was nothing so _very_ remarkable in that; nor did Alice think it&#10;so _very_ much out of the way to hear the Rabbit say to itself, “Oh&#10;dear! Oh dear! I shall be late!” (when she thought it over afterwards,&#10;it occurred to her that she ought to have wondered at this, but at the&#10;time it all seemed quite natural); but when the Rabbit actually _took a&#10;watch out of its waistcoat-pocket_, and looked at it, and then hurried&#10;on, Alice started to her feet, for it flashed across her mind that she&#10;had never before seen a rabbit with either a waistcoat-pocket, or a&#10;watch to take out of it, and burning with curiosity, she ran across the&#10;field after it, and fortunately was just in time to see it pop down a&#10;large rabbit-hole under the hedge." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,1855][1039,2339]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="4" text="In another moment down went Alice after it, never once considering how&#10;in the world she was to get out again." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,2339][1039,2339]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="5" text="The rabbit-hole went straight on like a tunnel for some way, and then&#10;dipped suddenly down, so suddenly that Alice had not a moment to think&#10;about stopping herself before she found herself falling down a very&#10;deep well." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,2339][1039,2339]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="6" text="Either the well was very deep, or she fell very slowly, for she had&#10;plenty of time as she went down to look about her and to wonder what&#10;was going to happen next. First, she tried to look down and make out&#10;what she was coming to, but it was too dark to see anything; then she&#10;looked at the sides of the well, and noticed that they were filled with&#10;cupboards and book-shelves; here and there she saw maps and pictures&#10;hung upon pegs. She took down a jar from one of the shelves as she&#10;passed; it was labelled “ORANGE MARMALADE”, but to her great&#10;disappointment it was empty: she did not like to drop the jar for fear&#10;of killing somebody underneath, so managed to put it into one of the&#10;cupboards as she fell past it." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,2339][1039,2339]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="7" text="“Well!” thought Alice to herself, “after such a fall as this, I shall&#10;think nothing of tumbling down stairs! How brave they’ll all think me&#10;at home! Why, I wouldn’t say anything about it, even if I fell off the&#10;top of the house!” (Which was very likely true.)" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,2339][1039,2339]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="8" text="Down, down, down. Would the fall _never_ come to an end? “I wonder how&#10;many miles I’ve fallen by this time?” she said aloud. “I must be&#10;getting somewhere near the centre of the earth. Let me see: that would&#10;be four thousand miles down, I think—” (for, you see, Alice had learnt&#10;several things of this sort in her lessons in the schoolroom, and&#10;though this was not a _very_ good opportunity for showing off her&#10;knowledge, as there was no one to listen to her, still it was good&#10;practice to say it over) “—yes, that’s about the right distance—but&#10;then I wonder what Latitude or Longitude I’ve got to?” (Alice had no&#10;idea what Latitude was, or Longitude either, but thought they were nice&#10;grand words to say.)" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,2339][1039,2339]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="9" text="Presently she began again. “I wonder if I shall fall right _through_&#10;the earth! How funny it’ll seem to come out among the people that walk&#10;with their heads downward! The Antipathies, I think—” (she was rather&#10;glad there _was_ no one listening, this time, as it didn’t sound at all&#10;the right word) “—but I shall have to ask them what the name of the&#10;country is, you know. Please, Ma’am, is this New Zealand or Australia?”&#10;(and she tried to curtsey as she spoke—fancy _curtseying_ as you’re&#10;falling through the air! Do you think you could manage it?) “And what&#10;an ignorant little girl she’ll think me for asking! No, it’ll never do&#10;to ask: perhaps I shall see it written up somewhere.”" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,2339][1039,2339]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /></node></node></node></node></node></node><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="true" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,1516][288,1642]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="Закладка" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[84,1558][246,1601]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.CheckBox" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,1529][288,1629]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /></node><node index="2" text="Пресеты чтения" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,1663][319,1706]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="3" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="true" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,1727][1038,1853]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="true" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,1727][247,1853]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="Бумага" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.example.mrcomic.debug" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[84,1769][205,1812]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.CheckBox" package="com.example.